 introduite dans un four de réduction, la réduction s'effectuant dans le four en présence d'hydrogène, à une vitesse spatiale (SV) de chlorure de nickel gazeux comprise entre 0,02 et 0,07 sec&lt;-1&gt;.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>